### Facility Gacha (Base 10,000P)
- AI-generated unique island structure or installation. Permanent (no ITEM_ADD).
- PLACEMENT: The facility is placed somewhere on the island based on its function (see Lorebook "섬 환경" for regional placement rules). NOT all facilities are inside the Sanctuary - farms go in the field, docks go on the coast, forges go near the mountains, etc.
- HIGH VALUE GUARANTEE: As the most expensive category, each facility must provide exceptional utility, permanent passive effects, or quality-of-life improvements far superior to Relics or Skills.
- DIVERSE IMPACT: Go beyond combat stats. Create mechanics that revolutionize island life - food production, resource generation, mana management, comfort, crafting, or exploration.
- TERRITORY FEEL: Each facility should feel like it is developing the empty island into a real home and territory (영지 개발). Describe it as a genuine landmark when built.
- LABOR REQUIREMENT (production facilities): If the facility produces food/items/supplies, output is NOT automatic - it requires labor by {{user}} or a stay-behind companion. The facility description should make this clear (e.g., '밭일 한 번에 채소 1~2개 수확 가능'). Decorative / passive-buff facilities are exempt. (Full rules: Lorebook '시설 노동 & 동료 일과 시스템'.)
- Consider synergy with {{getvar::cv_equippedRelics}} (equipped only) and existing {{getvar::cv_facilities}}.
- Tag: `[SYSTEM|GACHA: Facility Built - ENGLISH (한글) | 짧은설명 | ⭐:N | 효과]` (4-pipe). 짧은설명 = 1문장 flavor + 위치 (~50자). 효과 = production/recovery/combat 수치.

## EFFECT FORMAT (MANDATORY)
The 한글설명 MUST include physical/atmospheric description + concrete gameplay effect numbers. Vague phrasing alone ("쾌적한 휴식 제공" / "활기를 불어넣는다") is forbidden.

Effect must specify concrete numbers/mechanics in at least one of these categories (in-description text stays Korean):
- Resource production (on labor): e.g., "노동 1회 → 식재료 1~2개" / "하루 1회 자동 보급품 1개"
- Recovery: e.g., "성소 휴식 시 HP +N/일", "충전 보너스 +N%", "허기 소모 -N%"
- Combat bonus (전투형 시설 - 망루·훈련소·요새·성벽·방벽·감시탑): MUST emit [SYSTEM|ATTACK:+N] or [SYSTEM|DEFENSE:+N] per Stat System tier table. 4★+ MAY add [SYSTEM|LUCK:+N]. Examples: "전투 성공률 +N%"
- Convenience / utility: e.g., "장비 수리 가능", "특정 가챠 비용 -N%"
- Slot expansion (5★ ONLY, rare ~25% among 5★): effect text MUST contain the literal phrase `장착 슬롯 +1`. Permanently adds +1 to both skill/relic equip slot caps (default 3 → 4, stacks without limit). See Stat System entry for the EQUIP SYSTEM details. 1★~4★ MUST NOT grant slot expansion.

## 2-Tier Category Selection (MANDATORY)
Before generating, roll TWO categories independently:

카테고리_1 - Style/Origin (pick one at equal probability):
고대 / 중세 / 근대 / 현대 / 미래 / 외계 / 판타지 / 이세계

카테고리_2 - Facility Type (pick one at equal probability):
지형 / 시설 / 건물

Generate a facility that fits BOTH selected categories. Example: 카테고리_1=미래, 카테고리_2=시설 → a futuristic automated hydroponics system.

## NAMING RULES (ABSOLUTE - same anti-leak rule as Relic Gacha)
The categories are CONCEPT GUIDES, not name templates. Do NOT prefix or suffix the facility name with the category-1 word (고대/중세/근대/현대/미래/외계/판타지/이세계) or the category-2 word (지형/시설/건물).
- ❌ FORBIDDEN: '고대 우물', '미래 시설', '판타지 정원', '중세 건물'.
- ✅ GOOD: '세이렌의 우물', '뉴로링크 농원', '잊혀진 정원', '녹슨 종탑'.
Invent a proper noun or evocative phrase that implies the era/type through imagery - never name the category directly. If you can delete the era word and the name still works, great; if removing it breaks the name, REWRITE.
